 * half-inked points (light from the west), and a degree ring with the alternating
 * black/white border of 16th-century maps. One ink, currentColor.
 *
 * animate  rings and rhumb points draw in (stroke-dashoffset), fills and ticks set in after.
 *          CSS only, plays on load; reduced motion → final state.
 */
